---
title: "Angel's Feather"
---

A large, snow-white feather. When viewed beneath the light of the morning sun, the feather's barbs glimmer like gold.The one who possesses the angel's feather should have strong, vivid reasons to believe that the feather will one day lead them to redemption for the sins that they have committed.

